WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.901 line:92%
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show"

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:05.071 line:92%
at SummerStage in Central Park!

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:08.575 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:11.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have got a huge show
for you tonight.

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:12.779 line:92%
From the movie "A Simple Favor,"

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:15.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
Blake Lively is here
this evening.

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:17.183 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:21.554
Country-music superstar
Carrie Underwood is here!

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:23.123 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:27.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
And New York City is here
tonight, ladies and gentlemen!

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.329 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:32.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's fantastic.
We've got some special guests.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:34.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
The one and only
New York Philharmonic

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:36.436 size:84% position:42%
is here with The Roots,
ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:39.105 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:43.843 size:88% position:44%
And we have 1,500 people
in our audience tonight.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:44.844 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Look at you guys.

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:48.982 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:50.350 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:52.619 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:54.954 align:start size:94% position:6%
Of course, tickets
to tonight's show were free.

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:57.190 size:88% position:44%
So if you paid for those
on the street outside,

00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:00.093 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm sorry and welcome
to New York City.

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:02.228 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Uh, that's...

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:03.863 line:92%
Tonight we're making history

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:07.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
as the first late-night show
ever in Central Park.

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:10.236 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.308 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But, uh...

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:16.576 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:18.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, you guys,
I was born in New York.

00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:21.714
I was raised in New York.
I live in New York now.

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:23.083 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:26.519 align:start size:94% position:6%
I am such a New Yorker,
I can honestly say

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:29.289
I've only been to Central Park,
like, once before.

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:30.990 size:81% position:41%
I've driven through it
in a cab, but, yeah.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:33.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
For those of you who aren't
familiar with the park,

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:34.694 line:92%
we thought it might be helpful

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:36.429 align:start size:94% position:6%
to show you
some key sights here.

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:37.697 line:92%
Let's take a look at this map.

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:39.933 align:start size:94% position:6%
First up,
here's the SummerStage.

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:41.468 line:92%
That's where we are right now.

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:43.403 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:45.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
Next up, here's
a beautiful walking path

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:47.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
through the woods
called The Ramble.

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:49.876 size:88% position:44%
Fun fact -- that's where
they find all the bodies

00:01:49.876 --> 00:01:51.578 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
on "Law &amp; Order."

00:01:51.578 --> 00:01:54.414 size:88% position:44%
Next up, here's a statue
of Alexander Hamilton.

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:57.450
That's the only place in New
York City you can see Hamilton

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:00.787 align:start size:94% position:6%
without spending
1,000 bucks on StubHub.

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:03.490 align:start size:94% position:6%
Next up, here's
Strawberry Fields.

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:04.324 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:07.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's where every bad
guitar player in New York goes

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:08.728 size:81% position:41% line:92%
to ruin Beatles songs.

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:10.997
Of course, here's the Boathouse.
Beautiful.

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:12.932 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's where you see
two people on a bad date

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:15.602
because they can't leave because
they're stuck on a boat.

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:17.403 align:start size:94% position:6%
And finally
here's the Great Lawn...

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:20.306 align:start size:94% position:6%
or, as New York City dogs
call it, the master bathroom.

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:21.808 size:81% position:41% line:92%
What an amazing place.

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:23.877 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

